            <div xml:id="d670">

                <pb facs="0788" n="776" xml:id="pg776"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">841.248/1254: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ireland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dublin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-12-09T15:00:00+01:00">December 9, 1942—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 9—2:11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>247. British training plane piloted by American flyer landed on Phoenix Park race
                    track yesterday. Pilot released and sent back to Northern Ireland. Plane to go
                    back today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
